sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant Frontend as Frontend Admin
    participant AdminService as admin-service
    participant Auth as auth-service
    participant Context as Informations systeme / documents

    Admin->>Frontend: Envoyer une demande admin
    Frontend->>Auth: Verifier l'authentification
    Auth-->>Frontend: Autorisation valide
    Frontend->>AdminService: Transmettre la demande
    AdminService->>AdminService: Analyser la demande

    alt Demande frequente
        AdminService->>AdminService: Appliquer le fast path
        AdminService-->>Frontend: Retourner une reponse directe
    else Demande complexe
        AdminService->>Context: Recuperer le contexte utile
        Context-->>AdminService: Informations pertinentes
        AdminService->>AdminService: Executer l'agent recursif
        AdminService-->>Frontend: Retourner une reponse ou orientation
    end

    Frontend-->>Admin: Afficher le resultat
